# Loaded by `vite build` (production mode). Committed on purpose:
# the PostHog project key is a public client-side key that ships in the JS
# bundle regardless, so keeping it here means analytics works on every deploy
# without depending on Vercel dashboard configuration.
#
# Server-side secrets (KV, Stripe, etc.) do NOT belong in this file - those
# stay in Vercel project settings.

